{"id": "msg_3c30e7b12d184054bf7ba223ae219f40", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-849ce430-3976-4bcd-872b-3e61c77e6d48-173__fc_8b4e34e9-447c-91a0-99e1-bcfcffdeb298_2", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch037_seg01.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: 花边柳边，檐外晴丝正卷。\\n2: 山前水前，马上东风柔软。\\n3: 自叹行踪，有如蓬草随风飘转，心里盼望着家乡，留恋不舍。\\n4: 雁杳鱼沉，满怀离愁向谁传？\\n5: 北堂萱草日短，空劳魂梦牵绊。\\n6: 洛阳遥远，几时才能登上那九重金殿？\\n\\n(Showing lines 1-6 of 66. Use offset=7 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_3c30e7b12d184054bf7ba223ae219f40", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 320, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:49:11.129Z"}
{"id": "msg_395b500f0ecf40f197daf9cdee4eac9b", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-849ce430-3976-4bcd-872b-3e61c77e6d48-174__fc_8b4e34e9-447c-91a0-99e1-bcfcffdeb298_3", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch038_seg03.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n47: 婆子道：\\\"还饱着呢，不吃了。\\\"——心里只怕西门庆往王六儿家去，两步并作一步。正是：\\n48: \\n49: 媒人婆地里小鬼，两头来回抹油嘴。\\n50: 一日走够千千步，只是苦了两只腿。\\n\\n(End of file - total 50 lines)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_395b500f0ecf40f197daf9cdee4eac9b", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 272, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:49:11.132Z"}
