{"id": "msg_708aa25c005e48a6b01bcba36304ea65", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "这几处还是文言。按原文改开。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-183__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_0", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch034_seg03.md", "new_string": "各人自己扫檐前的雪，别去管别人屋上的霜。", "old_string": "各人自扫檐前雪，莫管他人屋上霜。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-184__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_1", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch038_seg00.md", "new_string": "两弯眉画成远山，一对眼睛像秋水。", "old_string": "两弯眉画成远山，一对眼睛像秋水。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-185__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_2", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch037_seg01.md", "new_string": "花边柳边，檐外的晴丝正卷着。\n山前水前，马上的东风柔软。", "old_string": "花边柳边，檐外晴丝正卷。\n山前水前，马上东风柔软。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-186__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_3", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch038_seg03.md", "new_string": "媒人婆是地里的小鬼，两头来回抹着油嘴。", "old_string": "媒人婆地里小鬼，两头来回抹油嘴。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-187__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_4", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch039_seg02.md", "new_string": "金杯里进酒，浮着香蚁；象板催着筝，唱那鹧鸪。", "old_string": "金尊进酒浮香蚁，象板催筝唱鹧鸪。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-188__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_5", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch039_seg03.md", "new_string": "懊恨薄情的人轻轻抛弃，离愁闲着自己烦恼。", "old_string": "懊恨薄情轻弃，离愁闲自恼。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-189__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_6", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch039_seg03.md", "new_string": "腰瘦了，所以知道是闲事烦恼；泪痕只为离别的情浓。", "old_string": "腰瘦故知闲事恼，泪痕只为别情浓。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-af382a1c-05c1-4b38-aff3-091131271f79-190__fc_bad3dac2-1e7a-931b-a038-644c089baf99_7", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch036_seg00.md", "new_string": "放声唱歌，倚着筝瑟，艳舞里尽逞媚姿。\n贵人一旦被他蛊惑，飞骑争相追随。", "old_string": "倚着筝瑟放声高歌，艳舞里尽逞媚姿。\n贵人一旦被他蛊惑，飞骑争相追随。"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:49:49.451Z"}
